flowchart TD
    %% 1. START & ONBOARDING
    Start([Start: User Accesses System]) --> Reg[Account Registration & Profile Setup]
    Reg --> UploadKYC[Upload Driver's License for KYC]
    UploadKYC --> ReviewKYC[Admin Reviews License Details]
    ReviewKYC --> CheckKYC{License Status?}

    CheckKYC -->|Approved| BrowseCars[Browse Fleet & Select Rental Dates]
    CheckKYC -->|Rejected| RejectKYC[Notify Rejection & Re-upload Valid Document]
    RejectKYC --> ReviewKYC2[Admin Re-evaluates License]
    ReviewKYC2 --> BrowseCars

    %% 2. BOOKING & AVAILABILITY
    BrowseCars --> CheckAvail{Vehicle Available?}
    CheckAvail -->|Available| SelectBooking[Select Insurance Package & Add-on Options]
    CheckAvail -->|Unavailable| ChangeChoice[Select Alternative Vehicle or Dates]
    ChangeChoice --> SelectBooking

    %% 3. PAYMENT & CONFIRMATION
    SelectBooking --> Payment[Process Payment: GCash, Card, or Cash]
    Payment --> CheckPay{Payment Status?}
    CheckPay -->|Confirmed| ConfirmBook[Lock Fleet Calendar & Dispatch Booking Confirmation]
    CheckPay -->|Failed| RetryPay[Retry Payment or Choose Alternative Method]
    RetryPay --> ConfirmBook

    %% 4. DISPATCH & ACTIVE TRIP
    ConfirmBook --> Handover[Pre-Rental Vehicle Inspection & Key Handover]
    Handover --> ActiveRental[Active Trip: Live GPS Tracking & Automated Reminders]

    %% 5. EXTENSION LOGIC
    ActiveRental --> ExtRequest{Extension Requested?}
    ExtRequest -->|Yes| CheckExt{Vehicle Available for Extension?}
    CheckExt -->|Approved| PayExt[Settle Extension Fee & Extend Calendar Schedule]
    PayExt --> ReturnVehicle
    CheckExt -->|Declined| DenyExt[Maintain Original Return Schedule]
    DenyExt --> ReturnVehicle

    ExtRequest -->|No| ReturnVehicle[Return Vehicle at Designated Location]

    %% 6. RETURN INSPECTION & SETTLEMENT
    ReturnVehicle --> ReturnInspect[Admin Return Inspection: Fuel Level, Odometer & Condition]
    ReturnInspect --> CheckPenalty{Late Return or Penalties?}

    CheckPenalty -->|Yes| ApplyPenalty[Calculate Late Penalty & Settle Outstanding Balance]
    ApplyPenalty --> FinalizeTrip
    CheckPenalty -->|No| FinalizeTrip[Complete Booking & Submit Customer Rating/Review]

    %% 7. CLOSING
    FinalizeTrip --> SystemLog[Update Vehicle Status to Available & Record Audit Logs]
    SystemLog --> End([End: Vehicle Ready for Next Booking])
